  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "HTTP 请求日志详情",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "当前查看 **${request_mode:text}**；慢请求模式的阈值为 **大于 ${slow_seconds:text}**。用顶部服务、分类、业务和接口筛选，日志保留 72 小时。\n\n只展示规范完成事件。点击 **traceId** 查关联日志；**OTel Trace ID** 是标准调用标识。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "日志保留与查询范围",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "日志保留 **72 小时**；下方显示所选时段最近 **200 条**匹配请求。缩小时间范围或选择接口，可以继续查看其他记录。\n\n指标保存时间可能长于日志。采集前、已过期或应用未写出的日志无法补回。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "所选时段慢请求估算数",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Prometheus 采样估算，历史保留范围通常大于日志；统计数量不代表对应日志一定仍存在。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "暂无数据",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "clamp_min(sum(increase(http_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"application\",service=~\"${service:pipe}\",exported_env=~\"$env\",host=~\"$host\",traffic=~\"${traffic:pipe}\",route=~\"${business:pipe}\",role=~\"$role\",method=~\"$method\",route=~\"$route\"}[$__range])) - sum(increase(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"application\",service=~\"${service:pipe}\",exported_env=~\"$env\",host=~\"$host\",traffic=~\"${traffic:pipe}\",route=~\"${business:pipe}\",role=~\"$role\",method=~\"$method\",route=~\"$route\",le=\"$slow_seconds\"}[$__range])), 0) or (0 * count(up{job=\"application\",service=~\"${service:pipe}\",env=~\"$env\",host=~\"$host\",role=~\"$role\"}))",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "列表为空时",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "检查**时间、服务和接口**；慢请求模式还需检查阈值。\n\n只显示采集后仍保留的日志，保留 72 小时。"
      }
